                                "Tell me what.",
                                "...",
                                "Yeah.",
                                "Yeah, I can see that.",
                                "I still think you were wrong.",
                                "But I can see how you got there.",
                                "That's rare.",
                                "Most people I disagree with, I can't see the road they took.",
                                "You're still in my list.",
                                "The short one.",
                                "Don't make me regret it."
